    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nightlife Tycoon</strong> you will build and manage your own venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to deal with extremely demanding customers and satisfy their requests. You will need to hire enough staff and be able to make your venue profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your customers happy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer has different tastes. You will have to serve each one their favorite drink, play the right music, and create a comfortable atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/9932e62dbde1ce93931f7eae2629df4b.poster.avif?t=1753180174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/9932e62dbde1ce93931f7eae2629df4b.webm?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/9932e62dbde1ce93931f7eae2629df4b.mp4?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organize unforgettable events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can organize special events. They have to be incredible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/0df34cac388b5802f0734b8bbb3950e8.poster.avif?t=1753180174\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/0df34cac388b5802f0734b8bbb3950e8.webm?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/0df34cac388b5802f0734b8bbb3950e8.mp4?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your venue famous</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will leave reviews. Make sure they give you 5 stars! The more positive reviews you have, the more people will be interested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract influencers and celebrities to boost your popularity even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great venue needs a great team. Hire bouncers to maintain security, DJs to light up the dance floor, flair bartenders, and fast waiters. Invest in their training to improve their skills and keep them happy to ensure impeccable service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your stock and warehouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready for every night by checking your inventory:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor storage capacity</strong>: every fridge or shelf increases your available space, make sure you have enough room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan restocks before the bar runs dry</strong>: an unsold cocktail is a lost customer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/a585420d4f15105fb90bdeb744c0f5f2.poster.avif?t=1753180174\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/a585420d4f15105fb90bdeb744c0f5f2.webm?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/a585420d4f15105fb90bdeb744c0f5f2.mp4?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create delicious cocktails</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire an expert bartender or train your own staff:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic recipes (Mojito, Negroni, Espresso Martini) or create your own original mixes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each drink requires specific ingredients: no stock, no service!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a true master of mixology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design the venue of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an empty space and customize every single detail. Choose the floors, the lights, the position of the bar and the DJ booth. Create exclusive VIP areas or a giant dance floor. The style is up to you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nightlife Tycoon</strong> you will build and manage your own venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to deal with extremely demanding customers and satisfy their requests. You will need to hire enough staff and be able to make your venue profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your customers happy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer has different tastes. You will have to serve each one their favorite drink, play the right music, and create a comfortable atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/9932e62dbde1ce93931f7eae2629df4b.poster.avif?t=1753180174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/9932e62dbde1ce93931f7eae2629df4b.webm?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/9932e62dbde1ce93931f7eae2629df4b.mp4?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organize unforgettable events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can organize special events. They have to be incredible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/0df34cac388b5802f0734b8bbb3950e8.poster.avif?t=1753180174\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/0df34cac388b5802f0734b8bbb3950e8.webm?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/0df34cac388b5802f0734b8bbb3950e8.mp4?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your venue famous</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will leave reviews. Make sure they give you 5 stars! The more positive reviews you have, the more people will be interested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract influencers and celebrities to boost your popularity even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great venue needs a great team. Hire bouncers to maintain security, DJs to light up the dance floor, flair bartenders, and fast waiters. Invest in their training to improve their skills and keep them happy to ensure impeccable service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your stock and warehouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready for every night by checking your inventory:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor storage capacity</strong>: every fridge or shelf increases your available space, make sure you have enough room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan restocks before the bar runs dry</strong>: an unsold cocktail is a lost customer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/a585420d4f15105fb90bdeb744c0f5f2.poster.avif?t=1753180174\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/a585420d4f15105fb90bdeb744c0f5f2.webm?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601630/extras/a585420d4f15105fb90bdeb744c0f5f2.mp4?t=1753180174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create delicious cocktails</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire an expert bartender or train your own staff:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic recipes (Mojito, Negroni, Espresso Martini) or create your own original mixes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each drink requires specific ingredients: no stock, no service!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a true master of mixology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design the venue of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an empty space and customize every single detail. Choose the floors, the lights, the position of the bar and the DJ booth. Create exclusive VIP areas or a giant dance floor. The style is up to you!</p>",
